 "remarks": "Room to gather, room to spread out and room for life's changing needs! Offering over 3,000 square feet of living space, 4 - 5 bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms and two primary suites, 31 Granite Drive offers a remarkable combination of space, comfort and flexibility in Norwalk's Cranbury neighborhood. The Great Room is the place for football Sundays, March Madness, movie nights and celebrations with family and friends! Imagine multiple screens, generous seating and everyone enjoying the action together. Sliding glass doors lead to a patio, with access to the backyard and a pathway to the inground pool. The sunny, updated kitchen features custom cabinetry, quartz countertops and a center island, while the adjoining dining and breakfast room provides a wonderful setting for everything from casual meals to family gatherings. Just beyond, the sun filled family room invites you to kick back, relax and enjoy those precious moments at home. One of the home's greatest assets is its exceptionally spacious main floor primary suite, featuring a walk-in closet, two additional double closets, an updated full bathroom and its own private exterior entrance. The generous dimensions offer exciting possibilities for extended family, guests or a potential In-Law arrangement. Upstairs, a second-floor primary suite features a beautifully updated bathroom, walk-in cedar closet and an adjoining room ideal for an office, library, sitting room or nursery.",
